---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Emon Hossain | AI Systems & Automation | Dhaka, Bangladesh"
  description="Emon Hossain builds practical AI systems, automation, and digital operating infrastructure for businesses. Explore the work, research, and ways to collaborate."
  ogTitle="Emon Hossain — Practical AI Systems & Automation"
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">EMONHOSSAIN.PRO</div>
    <h1>Practical AI systems.<br /><span class="gradient-text">Built for measurable business value.</span></h1>
    <p>I build and study AI systems, automation, and operating workflows for real businesses. This site is the public authority hub for my work, research, and selected projects.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20AI%20systems%20or%20automation%20project." class="btn-primary">Discuss an AI systems project</a>
      <a href="/about" class="btn-outline">About Emon</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">WORK &amp; RESEARCH</div>
      <h2>Operating businesses. Building systems. Publishing what is useful.</h2>
      <p>Public claims on this site are intentionally evidence-gated. Where a result is not ready for public verification, the site describes the work without inventing a number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <a href="https://sysmoai.com" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #1D4ED8);">S</div>
        <div class="role">AI SYSTEMS &amp; AUTOMATION</div>
        <h3>SYSmoAI</h3>
        <p>AI-agent, automation, implementation, and business-process systems for organizations that need practical outcomes rather than AI theatre.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Visit SYSmoAI &rarr;</div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://bangladeshai.org" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981, #047857);">B</div>
        <div class="role">RESEARCH &amp; INTELLIGENCE</div>
        <h3>BangladeshAI.Org</h3>
        <p>A research and intelligence asset focused on AI in Bangladesh, with an evidence-first publishing standard.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Explore BangladeshAI &rarr;</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/writing" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon brand-gradient">E</div>
        <div class="role">FOUNDER / OPERATOR</div>
        <h3>Writing &amp; field notes</h3>
        <p>Practical notes on AI implementation, automation economics, operating systems, research, and lessons from building.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Read the writing &rarr;</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--brand-stone-100);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <div class="eyebrow">HOW I WORK</div>
        <h2>Evidence before claims. Outcomes before tools.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="proof-card">
          <h3>Business first</h3>
          <p>Start with the customer, bottleneck, economics, risk, and desired outcome. Technology comes after the business case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-card">
          <h3>Controlled automation</h3>
          <p>Automate repetitive work with scoped permissions, verification, logging, human approval gates, and rollback where consequences matter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-card">
          <h3>Proof-led communication</h3>
          <p>Case studies, metrics, testimonials, and research claims should be backed by current evidence before they become public marketing claims.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" id="contact">
    <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
      <div class="eyebrow">CONTACT</div>
      <h2>Have a real AI or automation problem?</h2>
      <p>Send the current workflow, bottleneck, and desired outcome. I will route relevant business implementation work through SYSmoAI.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro" class="contact-card">
        <div class="label" style="color: var(--brand-indigo);">Email</div>
        <div class="value">contact@emonhossain.pro</div>
        <div class="hint">Business and media enquiries</div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693" class="contact-card">
        <div class="label" style="color: var(--brand-emerald);">WhatsApp</div>
        <div class="value">+880 1711-638693</div>
        <div class="hint">SYSmoAI + emonhossain.pro enquiries</div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://sysmoai.com" class="contact-card">
        <div class="label" style="color: var(--brand-ink);">SYSmoAI</div>
        <div class="value">AI systems &amp; automation</div>
        <div class="hint">Business implementation</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
